1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,737
Do you forget new words the very next day?

2
00:00:02,737 --> 00:00:03,739
You are not alone.

3
00:00:03,739 --> 00:00:06,799
Here is how to remember any word, in four simple steps.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,565
See it, in a real sentence.

5
00:00:09,565 --> 00:00:10,492
Say it out loud.

6
00:00:10,492 --> 00:00:12,115
Use it in your own sentence.

7
00:00:12,115 --> 00:00:14,666
And review it again tomorrow, and next week.

8
00:00:15,866 --> 00:00:22,023
For every new word, learn four things: its meaning, its sound, an example sentence, and a picture in your mind.

9
00:00:22,023 --> 00:00:22,800
Then it stays.

